          "description": "Swarm previously only supported local volumes, NFS, and a limited set of Docker Engine Plugin drivers that supported Swarm Mode. Driver support has dwindled over time as vendors moved to Kubernetes. In 2023, with the Docker Engine v23.x release, Docker Engine and Swarm Mode gained the Container Storage Interface (CSI) standard. Existing CSI drivers will need to add Swarm support.",
